CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeNumberOfLanesInDrivingDirection "Number of lanes in driving direction of new path: Also implies driving direction.0 denotes one-direction road driven in wrong direction, 1-5 are verbatim values, and 6 indicate 6 or more lanes. Value 7 means N/A.";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeNumberOfLanesInOppositeDirection "Number of lanes in opposite direction on new path 0 denotes one-direction road, 1 for one lane only; 2 indicates two or more lanes. Value 3 means N/A.";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeOffset "Offset of the position of the crossing from the start path position modulo 8191. Offset 8191 is invalid.";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgePartOfCalculatedRoute "0: New path from this point on is not part of Calculated Route 1: New path from this point on is part of Calculated Route 2: Unknown 3: N/A";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgePathIndex "Index of parent path; zero indicates this STUB starts first path in the Horizon.";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeRelativeProbability "[Value 0 (= 0%) indicates that turn is not allowed.][Value 30 (= 100%) indicates that this is the only possible turn.][Value 31 means unknown or N/A.]";
