CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeTurnAngle "Trun angle.For more details please see requiement HznEdgeMessage.";
CM_ SG_ 824 HznEdgeUpdate "Value true indicates that this message contains updated information of already transmitted STUB. 0x0:False 0x1:True";
